+# >>> X-CUPY-CACHE-POLICY block (Beta X-GCVM-LOCATED R2 Q2) >>>
+# Kernel-cache policy for ROCm rig workers. ON BY POLICY.
+#   per_run (default): each rig worker gets a NEW, EMPTY CuPy cache directory for this launch,
